cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "DAHD4: Python Conversion of Data-Adaptive Harmonic Decomposition"
abstract: >
  Python conversion of the DAHD (Data-Adaptive Harmonic Decomposition) MATLAB
  codebase developed for NSF-funded Arctic sea ice forecasting research.
  Includes full spectral decomposition pipeline, space-time DAHM computation,
  harmonic reconstruction, and multi-level stochastic Stuart-Landau model (MSLM)
  forecasting. Validated against original MATLAB output with documented bug fixes
  and RMSE verification.

